221:    /**
222:     * Sets the data layer offerings for a provider registered through
223:     * {@link #registerProvider(byte[])}.
224:     *
225:     * <p>Existing offerings for the provider ID will be replaced.
226:     *
227:     * @param providerId Provider ID
